Description: GUI tool for managing local Kubernetes cluster resources
 kubui is a desktop application that provides a native GUI for managing
 local Kubernetes clusters. It detects, installs, and manages CLI tools
 including minikube, helm, podman, and kubectl, all from a single window.
 .
 This package bundles all required CLI tools (kubectl, helm, minikube)
 and declares podman as a system dependency. Run `kubui` to launch the
 GUI or `kubui --check` to print tool status.
